	(text "MIDI IN: ring → 220 Ω → H11L1 LED → tip; 1N4148WS across the LED for reverse polarity. H11L1 switches at 1.6 mA\n(a worst-case 3.3 V sender still gives ≈4.5 mA). Output pulled up by 1 kΩ to +3V3D, then 1 kΩ to the link hole.\nThe IN jack's sleeve is NOT grounded (CA-033: no ground loop): wire it to MI_S (100 nF to ground) or leave it open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
