	(text "WIRING (two stereo jacks in deck cells):\nOUT: tip → MO_T, ring → MO_R, sleeve → the deck's D (ground) pad.\nIN:  tip → MI_T, ring → MI_R, sleeve → MI_S or open: NOT to D.\nTurn MIDI on: link SPARE1-MIDI_TX and SPARE2-MIDI_RX on J101.\nType B gear: swap that jack's tip and ring wires.\nBring-up: loop OUT to IN with a stereo cable; ≈1.2-1.3 V\nacross the 220 Ω while sending = 5.5-5.9 mA in the loop.\nThe H11L1 is ≈4 mm tall: place it outside the module footprint."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 214.63 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "804f3727-0395-54be-bdf7-3913705b8c2a")
	)
